      "alt_text": "Office Bearers\n /ˈɒf.ɪs ˌbeə.rəz/\n noun \n\nThe ones at the top of the organization chart and at the heart of every big decision. \n\nPresident: The head of the society, steering the team and keeping the bigger picture in sight.\n\nTreasurer: The numbers person, overseeing finances, logistics, and sponsorships to keep everything running smoothly.\n\nGeneral Secretary: The organisational backbone, handling administration, coordination, and event management.\n\nPress Secretary: The voice and visual identity of the society, leading social media marketing, publications, graphics etc.\n\nDirectorate\n/dɪˈrek.tər.ət/ \nnoun \nA collective of Directors and Deputy Directors, each leading a different portfolio and bringing their own skills, creativity, and a little bit of organised chaos to the society."
    },
