      "alt_text": "Wese toh most of the grocery shopping can be easily done from C1 or C2 but if that fails you, gather a bunch of your friends and hit the Royal cash and carry. It takes a 4 minute walk to get there from Gate-2 or a 2 minute car ride if you're feeling lazy. And hey! You can use this opportunity to explore Parched, a comfortable snack bar.\n\nIf you're looking for fruits that your mom keeps pestering you to eat, check out the H-13 \"Itwar Bazar\" which is also open on Tuesdays and Fridays (bad naming choice if you ask me). And if you’re craving that homely feeling, cut those fruits with that og piyaz wali churi to get woh mama k hath wala zaiqa ;).\n\nFeaturing \n@aneesxrahman \nVideography \n@soha__._\nVideo Editing \n@zahraligardez1"
    },
