      "alt_text": "Busy man about town (C2 and C3 kingdom his majesty presides over), Scar from the Lion King if he was an ear piercing baddie, and infinitely more regal, let me introduce you to Kharbuza! \nFor five years he has defended his land (C2 and C3) from foes and vanquished all containers of cat food with his swift tongue and dhamakaydar paws. You can’t tell him nothing, with his helix double pierced (do cats have helixes?) and his fluffy orange coat; you wish your cat had this swag. Our animal of the week remains wears his crown tall and proud (please give him all the food you have)."
    },
