      "alt_text": "This is Banana Bread, a senior at S3H, which makes it all the more important for every humanities student to know about. \n\nHome:She's S3H's unofficial mascot. \n\nFavorite Cuisine: Cat food.\n\nSignature Look: Tortoise Shell markings.\n\nPetting Tolerance: Unpredictable.\n\nSocial Battery: Limited.\n\nCommunication Style: Annoyed meows when she feels her boundaries are being crossed. \n\nMake sure to appreciate this bundle of controlled joy the next time you're in S3H. She's our first guest for our weekly Nust Animals Appreciation Series.\n\nGraphics: @rija_iqbal_ \nPhotography: @strayanimalsnust"
    },
